# Lylia, Little Witch

> Lylia is a mid-lane tempo mage disguised as a reset button. She wins when she owns the river from level 1, forces enemies to walk through pre-seeded bombs, and rewinds before the punish lands. If your draft needs a patient backline scaler who waits for 15 minutes, lock a different mage.

