- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Wilderness Blessing, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flameshot
- Flex: Arcane Boots over Magic Boots when Use when your team already controls rotations and early Magic Penetration matters more than maximum cooldown tempo.; Genius Wand over Ice Queen Wand when Use into mostly squishy drafts where faster Magic Defense shred beats extra slow control.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when one assassin or hard engage can still reach Lylia after Black Shoes is forced.
- Total cost: 10940 gold

Default mid build for river control, repeated bomb chains, anti-sustain pressure, and safe late-fight repositioning.

### Frontline Control (Mid)

